WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:16.192
Brad: Are we there yet?

2
00:00:16.193 --> 00:00:19.532
Danny: Why do you keep asking that question?

3
00:00:19.533 --> 00:00:23.368
Brad: Because it looks like we’re moving out of the city.

4
00:00:23.369 --> 00:00:29.561
Tina: You’re right. Hopian must live at the edge of the city.

5
00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:36.162
Danny: Look! There he is!

6
00:00:36.163 --> 00:00:39.498
Danny: Hopian, I’m so happy we found you.

7
00:00:39.499 --> 00:00:42.335
Danny: These are my friends, Brad and Tina.

8
00:00:42.336 --> 00:00:44.209
Hopian: Nice to meet you.

9
00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.343
I’m happy you’re here.

10
00:00:46.344 --> 00:00:57.081
Hopian: But, quickly, we must go inside.

11
00:00:57.082 --> 00:00:59.186
Tina: Wow!

12
00:00:59.187 --> 00:01:01.985
Danny: Everything is so big!

13
00:01:01.986 --> 00:01:04.920
Hopian: I hope you’ll be comfortable here.

14
00:01:04.921 --> 00:01:07.479
Brad: Is that your car, Hopian?

15
00:01:07.480 --> 00:01:12.294
It doesn’t look big enough for you.

16
00:01:12.295 --> 00:01:16.131
Hopian: Actually, that’s my son’s toy car.

17
00:01:16.132 --> 00:01:19.561
Danny: Your son’s toy car?

18
00:01:19.562 --> 00:01:23.470
Brad: I want to see how huge your TV is!

19
00:01:23.471 --> 00:01:28.002
Hopian: It’s in the living room.

20
00:01:28.003 --> 00:01:31.085
Brad: Huh. I’m not that impressed.

21
00:01:31.086 --> 00:01:36.990
Danny: I think I’ve seen bigger TVs back home.

22
00:01:36.991 --> 00:01:39.367
Hopian: There’s someone I’d like you to meet.

23
00:01:39.368 --> 00:01:41.459
Come in, Bello.

24
00:01:41.460 --> 00:01:43.211
Tina: Who’s that?

25
00:01:43.212 --> 00:01:46.123
Hopian: This is my son, Bello.

26
00:01:46.124 --> 00:01:48.431
Brad: A baby giant?

27
00:01:48.432 --> 00:01:51.367
Tina: He’s so cute!

28
00:01:51.368 --> 00:01:53.231
Hopian: It’s okay, Bello.

29
00:01:53.232 --> 00:01:55.084
These are my friends.

30
00:01:55.085 --> 00:01:57.133
Hopian: They’re here to help.

31
00:01:57.134 --> 00:01:59.796
Do you know what he likes?

32
00:01:59.797 --> 00:02:01.277
Danny: What?

33
00:02:01.278 --> 00:02:04.219
Hopian: He likes to play catch.

34
00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:14.359
Tina: Let’s play!

35
00:02:14.360 --> 00:02:16.423
Bello: Whee!

36
00:02:16.424 --> 00:02:19.355
Hopian: He’s happy, playing with you.

37
00:02:19.356 --> 00:02:24.286
Tina: He’s a lot of fun to play with!

38
00:02:24.287 --> 00:02:29.537
Danny: Yes, but it’s hard work.

39
00:02:29.538 --> 00:02:34.266
Brad: Say, Hopian, did you send that magic bug to us?

40
00:02:34.267 --> 00:02:37.455
Hopian: How did you figure that out, Brad?

41
00:02:37.456 --> 00:02:39.650
Brad: Everything else was gray.

42
00:02:39.651 --> 00:02:41.850
But the bug was red.

43
00:02:41.851 --> 00:02:45.360
Hopian: I made it from Bello’s magic clay.

44
00:02:45.361 --> 00:02:48.095
Danny: That was a good plan, Hopian.

45
00:02:48.096 --> 00:02:51.688
Hopian: We need to work on our next plan tomorrow.

46
00:02:51.689 --> 00:02:55.383
Hopian: But now, it’s time for Bello to sleep.

47
00:02:55.384 --> 00:02:59.920
Come on, Bello, it’s bedtime.

48
00:02:59.921 --> 00:03:03.014
All three: Good night, Bello.

49
00:03:03.015 --> 00:03:07.034
Bello: Night!

50
00:03:07.035 --> 00:03:11.690
Hopian: Bello’s fast asleep.

51
00:03:11.691 --> 00:03:16.143
Brad: I don’t know about you guys, but I’m tired too.

52
00:03:16.144 --> 00:03:20.338
Tina: Me too. I think we’re all tired.

53
00:03:20.339 --> 00:03:23.162
Hopian: You’ll need your strength tomorrow.

54
00:03:23.163 --> 00:03:25.724
Danny: So where are we going to sleep?

55
00:03:25.725 --> 00:03:29.467
Hopian: Follow me. I think I know a spot.

56
00:03:29.468 --> 00:03:34.230
Hopian: Good night, Danny, Tina, and Brad.

57
00:03:34.231 --> 00:03:39.215
All three: Good night, Hopian.
